{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115695","id":3232043575,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ApRI3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115695","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115695.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115695.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115695","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115695/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115695/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115695/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/897a67399061c6fe83a363c3bcb1fa9e9848d443","number":115695,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[UI] Fix CheckButton not applying disabled StyleBox","user":{"login":"snosrati200","id":242628136,"node_id":"U_kgDODnY2KA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/242628136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200","html_url":"https://github.com/snosrati200","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snosrati200/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"fixes #115661.\r\n\r\n## Issue\r\nThe `CheckButton` node was ignoring its specific `disabled` stylebox defined in a Theme. It was instead falling back to the default `Button` style because the drawing logic for the background was missing in its notification override.\r\n\r\n## Cause\r\n`CheckButton` overrides `_notification(NOTIFICATION_DRAW)` to handle its own icon and toggle logic, but it did not include logic to draw the background StyleBox. Furthermore, the `disabled` theme item was not bound to the class's theme cache.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n- Added `disabled_style` to `CheckButton::ThemeCache`.\r\n- Bound the `disabled` stylebox in `_bind_methods`.\r\n- Updated `_notification(NOTIFICATION_DRAW)` to manually render the background stylebox before drawing icons.\r\n- Adjusted margin calculations to correctly use the active state's (normal or disabled) stylebox.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n1. Created a Theme with distinct styles for `Button` (disabled) and `CheckButton` (disabled).\r\n2. Assigned the theme to a scene containing both nodes.\r\n3. Observed that the `CheckButton` now correctly uses its own green/custom disabled style instead of the generic button style.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creato